# Fitness Tracking App with GPS

Here's a working starter using **React Native (Expo)**, so it runs on iOS and Android from one codebase. It tracks a route, distance, duration, and pace, and saves workouts locally.

## 1. Setup

```bash
npx create-expo-app fitness-tracker
cd fitness-tracker
npx expo install expo-location react-native-maps @react-native-async-storage/async-storage
```

Add location permission text in `app.json`:

```json
{
  "expo": {
    "ios": {
      "infoPlist": {
        "NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription": "Used to track your workout route and distance."
      }
    },
    "android": {
      "permissions": ["ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION"]
    }
  }
}
```

